 *
 * Hardware:
 *   - MAX6675 thermocouple amplifier on SPI0 (CE0 / GPIO8, SCLK=GPIO11,
 *     MOSI=GPIO10, MISO=GPIO9)
 *   - Solid-state relay on GPIO17 (BCM)
 *
 * Build:
 *   gcc -O2 -Wall -o reflow reflow.c -lpigpio -lrt
 *
 * Run:
 *   sudo ./reflow
 */

