 * is read once per second; a HIGH-to-LOW transition is debounced
 * with a 50 ms re-read and logged to /var/log/flame_events.log.
 *
 * Build:  gcc -O2 -Wall -Wextra -o flame_monitor flame_monitor.c -lgpiod
 * Run:    sudo ./flame_monitor
